  1909: certified=551  repaired=546  recovered=540  multiengine=140 fixed=501 (merged was 485)
  1911: certified=397  repaired=400  recovered=395  multiengine=284 fixed=368 (merged was 1)
chaptered_v2 absent in all three (not required; certified is the lead trusted pass).

